# Use the VS Code REST Client extension, or import the Postman collection.
# Obtain a JWT from Login and paste it into @token. Never paste it into public sites.
@base = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-login-token-here
@adminToken = paste-organizer-token-here
@eventId = evt_neon_nights_2026
@seatId = A2
@checkoutKey = lab-checkout-unique-key-0001

### Save appearance for the authenticated account
PATCH {{base}}/api/auth/me/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"theme":"light"}

### Register — role is always student
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Lab Student","email":"lab-student@example.test","password":"secure-demo-password"}

### Login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"student@college.edu","password":"student123"}

### My profile
GET {{base}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Catalog — optional category and literal search
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/events?category=All&search=

### One event
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/events/{{eventId}}

### Live seat map — dimensions come from the event, never the query string
GET {{base}}/api/booking/seats/{{eventId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Hold — 600-second lease
POST {{base}}/api/booking/hold
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{eventId}}","seatId":"{{seatId}}"}

### Confirm — reuse this exact key when retrying this checkout
POST {{base}}/api/booking/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: {{checkoutKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{eventId}}","seatId":"{{seatId}}"}

### Release — only a still-held seat owned by this user
POST {{base}}/api/booking/release
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{eventId}}","seatId":"{{seatId}}"}

### My tickets
GET {{base}}/api/booking/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My email delivery records
GET {{base}}/api/notifications/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Live service health
GET {{base}}/api/health/booking

### Cache metrics
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/metrics

### Hold metrics
GET {{base}}/api/booking/metrics

### Organizer login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"organizer@college.edu","password":"student123"}

### Admin event creation
POST {{base}}/api/catalog/events
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Campus Design Night","description":"A creative campus gathering.","category":"Workshop","venue":"Studio 4","date":"2099-11-20","time":"18:00 IST","price":99,"seatLayout":{"rows":5,"seatsPerRow":10}}

### Admin email delivery log
GET {{base}}/api/notifications/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Hold multiple seats atomically (1–10 unique IDs)
POST {{base}}/api/booking/hold
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{eventId}}","seatIds":["A2","A3"]}

### Confirm the entire group with one idempotency key
POST {{base}}/api/booking/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: group-checkout-unique-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":"{{eventId}}","seatIds":["A2","A3"]}

### Supported discovery locations
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/discovery/options

### Real third-party events (requires Gemini server configuration)
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/discovery?city=Noida&category=All&q=music
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
